'''Old Glory''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[American Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

==Appearance==
It has a blue blade with 4 white stars on it, representing the 4th of July. The handle has a bulbous type of shape and it is maple in color. The guard takes shape of a cutlass sword’s guard, and the color is red and white, resembling the stripes of the American flag.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/264991177/American-Monster-Blade American Monster Blade].
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Amerilaser]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Old_Glory_Set Old Glory Set], and with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Sammy]], making the Full Old Glory Set. 
*When salvaged, it provides 72 godly [[Shards|shards]].

